     4	**Status**: PARTIAL PASS — median Spearman = 1.0000 in all (problem, phase) buckets (consistent with the analytic rank-invariance argument); predeclared joint Gate 5 still fails because 2/17 buckets breach JS ≤ 0.02 (GP-fit numerical fragility, not analytic violation).
